================================================================================
DATA SOURCES AND ATTRIBUTION
================================================================================

This project builds on data published by others. Every number in reports/ is
derived from one of these sources. No model checkpoint, and no large upstream
dataset (Materials Project, WBM, MPtrj), is redistributed here -- the setup
instructions fetch them from their original homes.

Two public-domain sources ARE vendored verbatim, so that the reference-data build
reproduces without network access: one NASA technical memorandum and a set of
cached Crystallography Open Database query responses, both under
reference_data/raw/. Both are public domain (a US Government work, and CC0
respectively) and neither is under any grant this project makes. See
reference_data/LICENSE.

