Nordlund et al., Nature Communications 9, 1084 (2018) -- CC BY 4.0
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The threshold displacement energies quoted in the Stage 2 draft (reports/drafts/) for Fe, Cu, Ni,
Pd, Pt and W are taken from Table 1 of the paper below, which is open access under the Creative
Commons Attribution 4.0 International licence (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/).
Changes were made: values were selected and compared with other sources.

  K. Nordlund, S. J. Zinkle, A. E. Sand, F. Granberg, R. S. Averback, R. Stoller, T. Suzudo,
  L. Malerba, F. Banhart, W. J. Weber, F. Willaime, S. L. Dudarev, D. Simeone, "Improving atomic
  displacement and replacement calculations with physically realistic damage models",
  Nature Communications 9, 1084 (2018). doi:10.1038/s41467-018-03415-5

The review K. Nordlund et al., J. Nucl. Mater. 512, 450 (2018), doi:10.1016/j.jnucmat.2018.10.027
(CC BY-NC-ND 4.0) and the abstracts of two Physical Review papers on aluminium (Neely and Bauer,
1966; Simpson and Chaplin, 1969, (c) American Physical Society) were read for facts only; no text
is reproduced.

