Angsten et al. vacancy database -- CC BY 3.0
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Per-element PBE vacancy formation energies in reports/aerospace_vacancy_population.*
are taken from Tables A.1 and A.2 of the paper below, which is open access under the
Creative Commons Attribution 3.0 licence (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/3.0/).
